{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>ויט אהלה.</b> Rashi explained: אהלה is written, teaching that first he pitched the tent of his wife. And if you ask: concerning ויתגל בתוך אהלה of Noah — what did he derive from it? The answer is: the ten tribes were exiled on account of wine, as it is written ״השותים במזרקי יין״, and they were in Samaria, which is called אהלה, as it is written in Ezekiel: ״ויקרא לשומרון אהלה ולירושלים אהליבה״."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:05:28.580526585Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}